cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, cite version 0.3.0 and the exact commit used."
title: "FractalGuard RAG: Protocol apparatus for authorization-first retrieval governance"
abstract: >-
  Version 0.3.0 packages the protocol and executable apparatus for a prospective
  five-corpus confirmatory study of authorization-first, geometry-aware vector
  retrieval. It includes policy-decision integration, physically authorized
  search, evidence scoring, corpus normalization, cluster-aware inference, frozen modeling
  contracts, drift controls, audit chaining, artifact verification, and
  process-local label withholding. The external registration is published only
  after the exact C1 freeze and before any admissible online execution. Public
  benchmark labels remain accessible outside the apparatus, and the study does
  not claim human outcome blindness or independent organizational custody.
  Version 0.3.0 reports no confirmatory finding.
